      "html": "<p>Paweł Marks is Scala Compiler Engineer at Virtuslab, Kraków. He is also the main maintainer of Eclipse Kotlin Plugin and co-organizer of Kraków Kotlin User Group - the most active Kotlin community in Poland.<br>He loves to get to know new programming languages, compare them, and rant about them. Privately he is interested in linguistics, history and enjoys surreal memes.</p>"
